# Tier names for the BC-250 fork's DLL rebuilt for GCN4.
#
# It replaces its own shaders for every role but one. pass11 still reaches the driver as AMD wrote
# it, so a set replaces that one shader and nothing else. On this build that is worth nothing
# measurable, 15.01 ms of frametime against 15.00 ms, so the tiers exist to make the names work
# rather than because they buy anything.
#
# `lossless` stays `off` because the `exact` set has no pass11 shader to offer.
lossless=off
quality=fin15
balanced=fin25
speed=prune16
